[I] Hyprland's idle daemon

[T] hypridle is Hyprland's idle daemon, based on the ext-idle-notify-v1
[T] Wayland protocol. It runs configured commands on idle timeouts and
[T] supports loginctl lock, unlock and before-sleep events and D-Bus
[T] inhibition.

[U] https://wiki.hypr.land/Hypr-Ecosystem/hypridle/

[A] vaxerski
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] base/x11
[F] CROSS OBJDIR

[L] BSD
[V] 0.1.8

[D] 6f56fe70ea0089a5b9ac2cc487cca452d3e4eff3e6ada4eb4ba445e5 hypridle-v0.1.8.tar.gz https://github.com/hyprwm/hypridle/archive/refs/tags/v0.1.8/

atstage cross && export PKG_CONFIG_SYSROOT_DIR=$root
